Free tempo dressed as Line numbers and Spelling (.lyr-tog). Every corner app.css set in pixels now follows Engine's three profiles (--r-xs/sm/md/lg/pill; --r-xs new: round 3, soft 2, square 1, so the icon frames keep their 2px in the soft profile); circles, hairlines and the tiny lock left as they were. Guidance and Lyrics guidance: a road before each field (red under 1, green in Viktor's range, amber past it, red far past), the fields of the samplers' height; the number stays the truth, the road follows it whoever sets it, a drag writes it. A take's hover tools in one flowing row (Refine's Russian word lay under «mp3»), the title clear of them by their measured width.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
